       >>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. P-37-UNSTRING-MULTIPLE.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 SRC PIC X(12) VALUE "AA:BB,CC:DD ".
01 A PIC X(3).
01 B PIC X(3).
01 C PIC X(3).
01 D PIC X(3).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
UNSTRING SRC DELIMITED BY ":" OR "," INTO A B C D
DISPLAY A
DISPLAY B
DISPLAY C
DISPLAY D
STOP RUN.
